   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 0,
   "text": "Help! A terrible creature is in our hut! Please get rid of it for us."
  },
  {
   "index": 1,
   "raw": "ff00030001030003",
   "x": 255,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": false,
   "sprite": 3,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 3,
   "aiName": "face_hero",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 3,
   "text": "{0x01}\n{0x85}The caverns in this region are burning hot; you won't be able to stand it long. I've got something that will help you. It's an Asbestos cape that will protect you from the heat.{0x87}It's not free though. It will cost you 2500&almas.\n\n\n{0x89}Oh, I&see... well, maybe next time. "
  },
  {
   "index": 2,
   "raw": "1800810001030012",
   "x": 24,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 1,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 3,
   "aiName": "face_hero",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 18,
   "text": "Sir, I can see that you don't have the Elf Crest. Recently some henchmen of Jashiin have been posing as heroes and wreaking havoc on this town. You're not one of them by any chance, are you? Without the Elf Crest, no one here will speak to you."
  },
  {
   "index": 3,
   "raw": "0e0080000106000a",
   "x": 14,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 0,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 6,
   "aiName": "bounce_2bit",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 10,
   "text": "My name is Michael. No one here listens to a word I say. I wonder why that is?"
  },
